res further activation steps.","case .activating:","    \/\/ Card is currently activating.","case .suspended:","    \/\/ Card suspended by the issuer.","case .deactivated:","    \/\/ Card deactivated.","case .unknown:","    \/\/ State could not be determined.","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"text":"Wallet Extension","type":"heading","anchor":"Wallet-Extension"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition to in-app provisioning, you can let cardholders provision cards directly from the Apple Wallet app. When configured, your app appears in Wallet’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"From Apps on Your iPhone","type":"text"}]},{"text":" section.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sessions approach provides a high-level base class, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletExtensionHandler"},{"type":"text","text":", that handles the full extension flow. You subclass it and override a small set of methods."}]},{"anchor":"Prerequisites","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In-app provisioning must be working first.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement must be present on the main app, Non-UI Extension, and UI Extension targets."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A shared keychain access group must be configured (the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"keychainAccessGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" you passed to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target","text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","level":3},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"co